From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TripleU <182648541+TripleU613@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 22:55:11 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] J714s image: auto-brightness roles (omarchy-brightness-auto,
 wluma)

Two support roles, from betizzel/omarchy-m5 3813ca0 (release 11 part 1):
- omarchy-brightness-auto 0.1.20261118-1 (any): the script by joshuaswarren
  from omacom/omarchy-mac-pkgs #144, unchanged; off until
  "omarchy brightness auto on".
- wluma 5.0.4-1 (aarch64): the AUR recipe built for aarch64.
Both tested on our J714s 2026-11-26 (the panel followed the light sensor,
"off" restored manual). The j714s profile now names 22 roles.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
